Z||000000||Philphine||10-05-2000||11:52 AM||||<BR>anybody else collecting up scoops and vents to try on their hoods and sides? what have you got and how do you plan to use it/them? right now i've got:<P>2 of those big cowl induction type scoops off an early '80's camaro.<P>a pair of those vents that were behind the back wheels of a '69 mustang mach 1 (i think). contoured funny, but i may try them on a spare hood if i can mold them in well enough.<P>a pair of louvers from a '68 (i think) mustang fastback ( might be interesting as a rear side glass replacement on a gt, kinda long on the hood).<P>a pair of side vents from behind the front whees of an '81 (about) camaro. those i used on my '87 hood.<P>got them all fairly cheap. what have you found and how are you trying to use it/them? <P>------------------<BR>Phil T<P>'87 coupe (feral)<BR>'84 indy<BR>'84 coupe (cheap thrill)||||reg||1
